<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">The above unaudited standalone and consolidated financial results of the Co have been prepared in accordance with the IndAS as notified by MCA pursuant to Sec 133 of Co Act read with Rule and as per regulation 33 of the SEBI LODR Regulations        The consolidated financial results comprise the financial results of the Co and its subsidiaries      The Board of ILJIN at its meeting held on 16 Sep 2023 approved an arrangement for entering into a JV with Nexxbase JV agreement was entered into on 18 Sep 2023 and the underlying JVC namely Stelltek Technologies Pvt Ltd has been incorporated on 26 Dec 2023 IL JIN shall own 50% of shareholding in the JVC The JVC will carry on the business of manufacturing assembling and designing of wearables and other smart electronics products      The Board of IL JIN at its meeting held on 21 Oct 2023 has given an inprincipal approval for investment in Ascent ILJIN has entered into definitive agreements on 2 Jan 2024 for acquiring 60% equity shares in Ascent and pursuant to the said agreement ILJIN has paid full consideration on 2 Feb 2024 Pursuant to the said acquisition Ascent has become subsidiary of IL JIN and stepdown subsidiary of Co      The Board of  Sidwal at its meeting held on 20 Oct 2023 approved formation of a joint venture alliance with Titagarh and its promoters for undertaking investment in Shivaliks Mercantile Pvt Ltd an existing company which will become a JVSPV to carry on the business of railway components and sub systems for the rolling stock industry in India and overseas and also expand their business into the global markets and are desirous of undertaking investment in Titagarh Firema SpA Italy which is inter alia in the similar business Both Titagarh and Sidwal will invest up to Rs12000 lakhs each in the JVSPV in one or more tranches Subsequent to the period ended 31 Dec 2023 Sidwal has entered into definitive agreements dated 24 Jan 2024 for acquiring equal control in Shivaliks      Subsequent to the period ended 31 Dec2023 the Holding Company has on 31 Jan 2024 acquired 3100, 9% OFCD of Rs10 lakhs each for aggregating to amounting Rs 31000 lakhs of IL JIN       The Board of IL JIN at its meeting held on 10 Feb 2024 and Ever at its meeting held on 8 Feb 2024 has approved the scheme of amalgamation among IL JIN and Ever The Board of the Co also in its meeting dated 10 Feb 2024 approved the above scheme The scheme is yet to be filed with NCLT for required approvals. The effect of the scheme is considered in these financial results</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
